emaining': '5'}, 'is_translatable': False, 'views': {'count': '14177', 'state': 'EnabledWithCount'}, 'source': '<a href="http://twitter.com/download/iphone" rel="nofollow">Twitter for iPhone</a>', 'note_tweet': {'is_expandable': True, 'note_tweet_results': {'result': {'id': 'Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE4NzIzODQ2MzE4MjUxOTUwMDg=', 'text': '🧵 Goodbye, 23&ME.\nHello, DNA Complete Inc. 🧬 \nFounded by George Church… \nand… 🥁 \n\n💥 Protected by CrowdStrike. \n\n💥 Partnering with Optum, an arm of UnitedHealth Group. \n\n💥 Bought by ProPhase Labs (formerly Quigley — Asbestos claims funded by Pfizer in 2013)\n\nWas the entire board of 23&ME resigning a few weeks ago just a distraction to launch DNA Complete?\n\nGeorge Church, who resigned from 23&Me in December 2019 just before his BGI business launched their global COVID testing campaign, has recently launched DNA Complete Inc under his other company called Nebula. They claim 23&Me could only sequence 0.1% of your DNA, while DNA Complete has the ability to sequence 100% of your DNA, looking at everything from physical attraction, age of losing virginity, and walking pace to family planning and your entire ancestry. \n\nIf you don’t know about George Church and the accusations against him on straying into eugenics, search my page for his name as well as my highlights, or you can simply google it. He claims one day, everyone (including before conception and at birth) could be using this product. \n\nRuss Altman is also on the advisory board. Russ advises the FDA and NIH on shaping national health policy and regulatory approval processes, creating a glaringly obvious conflict of interest. He also works in the field of AI.\n\nThe other concerning factor? Their cybersecurity is run by CrowdStrike. You know, the one that caused a major outage that affected governments across the world and shut down flights across the nation. It also effected healthcare facilities and emergency services, costing around $5.4B in damages. \n\nDNA Complete CEO Ted Karkus also became very defensive in an interview when asked about CrowdStrike’s involvement with DNA Complete. There’s so much to dissect in this interview with Ted Karkus, I’ll include it here for you to decide for yourselves the motive. https://t.co/NOw5jobNGI', 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'urls': [{'display_url': 'm.investing.com/news/stock-mar…', 'expanded_url': 'https://m.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/earnings-call-prophase-labs-focuses-on-growth-amid-seasonal-challenges-93CH-3572813?ampMode=1', 'url': 'https://t.co/NOw5jobNGI', 'indices': [1893, 1916]}], 'user_mentions': []}}}}, 'legacy': {'bookmark_count': 56, 'bookmarked': False, 'created_at': 'Thu Dec 26 20:50:58 +0000 2024', 'conversation_id_str': '1872384632043274275', 'display_text_range': [0, 276], 'entities': {'hashtags': [], 'media': [{'display_url': 'pic.x.com/OfP2etBhSM', 'expanded_url': 'https://x.com/Bithiah333/status/1872384632043274275/photo/1', 'id_str': '1872384626976567296', 'indices': [277, 300], 'media_key': '3_1872384626976567296', 'media_url_https': 'https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GfwL5d3XMAAG_-K.jpg', 'type': 'photo', 'url': 'https://t.co/OfP2etBhSM', 'ext_media_availability': {'status': 'Available'}, 'features': {'large': {'faces': [{'x': 1344, 'y': 212, 'h': 240, 'w': 240}]}, 'medium': {'faces': [{'x': 858, 'y': 135, 'h': 153, 'w': 153}]}, 'small': {'faces': [{'x': 486, 'y': 76, 'h': 86, 'w': 86}]}, 'orig': {'faces': [{'x': 1344, 'y': 212, 'h': 240, 'w': 240}]}}, 'sizes': {'large': {'h': 1205, 'w': 1878, 'resize': 'fit'}, 'medium': {'h': 770, 'w': 1200, 'resize': 'fit'}, 'small': {'h': 436, 'w': 680, 'resize': 'fit'}, 'thumb': {'h': 150, 'w': 150, 'resize': 'crop'}}, 'original_info': {'height': 1205, 'width': 1878, 'focus_rects': [{'x': 0, 'y': 0, 'w': 1878, 'h': 1052}, {'x': 0, 'y': 0, 'w': 1205, 'h': 1205}, {'x': 0, 'y': 0, 'w': 1057, 'h': 1205}, {'x': 0, 'y': 0, 'w': 603, 'h': 1205}, {'x': 0, 'y': 0, 'w': 1878, 'h': 1205}]}, 'media_results': {'result': {'med